        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I recently found Zephyl for the Robe quest, and here is a little spawn info for you:</P><P>Zephyl spawns in Rathe Mountains and is much easier to get to spawn then old Qwinn, mainly because he wanders a set path, and his PH's are evident, they are either Hasten Bootstrutter, Maldren the Unkept (spelling?), or a drake of about level 30.  </P><P>So all you have to do to get Zephyl to spawn is keep killing the phs (spawn time is about 20 minutes).</P><P>I recently did the quest, and after waiting for him to spawn for 8 hours, I decided to start whacking the ph's (hasten was a little tough for me at 48, so I needed to recruit help for it). After killing hasten 3 times, and the drake ph 3 times, Bro Zephyl popped up for me. </P><P>Chakar</P><P> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
